\newlabel{tab:params_working_emission_room_015_calibrated_anchor_ar1_hmm_beta_1_K4}{{5.3}{23}{Room 015: estimated working emission parameters of the AR(1)-HMM($\beta $,1) with $K=4$ states. The state means are $\mu _1 = \mu _0$ and $\mu _k = \mu _{k-1} + \exp (\log (\mu _k - \mu _{k-1}))$, $\sigma = \exp (\log \sigma )$ and $\phi = 2\,\mathrm {sigmoid}(\tilde {\phi }) - 1$. Brackets give 95\% Wald confidence intervals (estimate $\pm 1.96$ SE)}{table.caption.17}{}}
